#: luci-app-mptcp/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mptcp/mptcp_dscp_routing.js:109
msgid ""
"Choose which WAN carries each DSCP-tagged traffic class -- for the MPTCP "
"bpf_dscp scheduler and for mqvpn -- and review the per-WAN weight used by "
"the *weight schedulers on both. This page only edits the pins/weights; pick "
"the scheduler that actually uses them on the MPTCP and MQVPN pages "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz quin WAN pòrta cada classa de trafic marcada DSCP — per "
"l'ordonançador MPTCP bpf_dscp e per mqvpn — e verificatz lo pes per WAN "
"utilizat pels ordonançadors *weight suls dos. Aquesta pagina modifica "
"solament las afectacions e los peses ; causissètz l'ordonançador que los "
"utiliza vertadièrament sus las paginas MPTCP e MQVPN elas meteissas."

