"Used by the *weight MPTCP schedulers (bpf_weight/bpf_weight_rr) and by "
"mqvpn’s \"Weighted RTT\"/\"Weighted Round Robin\" schedulers -- same value, "
"applies to both upload and download (mirrored to the gateway automatically)."
" Unlike the DSCP pins above, weight is a single value per WAN, not per "
"traffic class."
msgstr ""
"Utilizat pels ordonançadors MPTCP *weight (bpf_weight/bpf_weight_rr) e pels "
"ordonançadors « Weighted RTT »/« Weighted Round Robin » de mqvpn — meteissa "
"valor, aplicada a l'encòp al mandadís e a la recepcion (replicada "
"automaticament cap a la palanca). Al contrari de las afectacions DSCP çai-"
"sus, lo pes es una valor unica per WAN, pas per classa de trafic."

