msgstr "Pes"

#: luci-app-mptcp/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mptcp/mptcp.js:118
#: luci-app-mptcp/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mptcp/mptcp_dscp_routing.js:127
msgid ""
"When using a DSCP or weight BPF scheduler, also sync each WAN’s pin to the "
"gateway (VPS) so it also holds for traffic the gateway sends (downloads), "
"not just traffic the router sends (uploads). Disabling this only stops "
"future syncs -- it does not remove pins already pushed to the gateway."
msgstr ""
"Amb un ordonançador BPF DSCP o de pes, sincronizar tanben l'afectacion de "
"cada WAN cap a la palanca (VPS) per que s'aplique tanben al trafic mandat "
"per la palanca (telecargaments), e pas solament a lo mandat pel router "
"(mandadisses). Desactivar aquesta opcion arrèsta solament las "
"sincronizacions venentas — las afectacions ja transmesas son pas levadas de "
"la palanca."

#: luci-app-mptcp/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mptcp/mptcp_dscp_routing.js:128
msgid ""
"While disabled, the DSCP table below only shows Upload -- Download has no "
"effect until this is re-enabled and applied."
msgstr ""
"Tant qu'aquò es desactivat, lo tablèu DSCP çai-jos aficha solament lo "
"mandadís — la recepcion a cap d'efièch fins que siá reactivat e aplicat."

